{"id":"21ce7cb11eb92c41","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-completion-run.md","title":"df-completion-run","display":"df-completion-run","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-completion-run","aliases":["56-df-completion-run"],"display":"df-completion-run","depends_on":["[[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]]"],"source_section":"7.4 Table 7.7; 7.4.2; 7.5.8","source_pages":"278–280; 286","source_ocr_blocks":[299,300,301,307],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-completion-run"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-completion-run</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completion-run"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00208e314088402a\" href=\"?note=00208e314088402a\" title=\"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion\">56-df-knuth-bendix-completion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.4 Table 7.7; 7.4.2; 7.5.8"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"278–280; 286"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>299</span><span>300</span><span>301</span><span>307</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00208e314088402a\" href=\"?note=00208e314088402a\" title=\"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion\">56-df-knuth-bendix-completion</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,&gt;\">\\(\\Sigma,V,&gt;\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\">\\(E_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\)</span>，候选输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le n\\}\">\\([0,n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,n)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\">\\([0,n)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为以0起始的有限序列，元素属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\)</span>，不预设长度或端点。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i,B_i\">\\(A_i,B_i\\)</span> 分别表示下文有界序列变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B\">\\(\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 处的值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KBRun}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,D,n)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)^{[0,n]}\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle(A_i,B_i)\\rangle_{i\\in[0,n]}\\land A_0=E_0\\land B_0=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in[0,n]\\;\\mathrm{KBState}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(A_i,B_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in[0,n)\\;\n\\mathrm{KBStep}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(A_i,B_i,A_{i+1},B_{i+1})\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,R)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists D\\in\\bigl(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\bigr)^{[0,n]}\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{KBRun}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,D,n)\\land D_n=(\\varnothing,R)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KBRun}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,D,n)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)^{[0,n]}\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle(A_i,B_i)\\rangle_{i\\in[0,n]}\\land A_0=E_0\\land B_0=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in[0,n]\\;\\mathrm{KBState}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(A_i,B_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in[0,n)\\;\n\\mathrm{KBStep}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(A_i,B_i,A_{i+1},B_{i+1})\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,R)\\iff{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists D\\in\\bigl(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\bigr)^{[0,n]}\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{KBRun}_{\\Sigma,V,&gt;}(E_0,D,n)\\land D_n=(\\varnothing,R)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>序列分量在有界函数域中显式绑定；零步运行也有索引0，空候选序列不满足运行谓词，不会对其未定义端点求值。</p>\n<p>有限成功意味着初始等式和每次新增规则产生的全部临界对义务最终均经正规化、定向或删除处理；不能把仅找到一个与 E 等价的终止 R 叫作成功。Table 7.7 的这种有限成功自带全部义务清空的条件，因此 Theorem 7.4.2 不另加公平假设。对 §7.5 的抽象 BC 推导，公平有独立数学内容：不永久搁置等式且所有出现的临界对最终进入等式集合；它不能由“有推导序列”自动推出。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；7.4 Table 7.7; 7.4.2; 7.5.8，印刷页 278–280; 286。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion","status":"resolved","id":"00208e314088402a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-knuth-bendix-completion","status":"resolved","id":"00208e314088402a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]] 的 $\\Sigma,V,>$ 及 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。输入 $E_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$，候选输出 $R\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$[0,n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le n\\}$，$[0,n)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}$。$D$ 为以0起始的有限序列，元素属于 $\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)$，不预设长度或端点。$A_i,B_i$ 分别表示下文有界序列变量 $\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B$ 在 $i$ 处的值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,V,>","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"E_0\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[0,n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i\\le n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[0,n)=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)","display":false},{"tex":"A_i,B_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{KBRun}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,D,n)\\iff{}&\n\\exists\\boldsymbol A,\\boldsymbol B\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)^{[0,n]}\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle(A_i,B_i)\\rangle_{i\\in[0,n]}\\land A_0=E_0\\land B_0=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in[0,n]\\;\\mathrm{KBState}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(A_i,B_i)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall i\\in[0,n)\\;\n\\mathrm{KBStep}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(A_i,B_i,A_{i+1},B_{i+1})\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,R)\\iff{}&\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists D\\in\\bigl(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(T^2)\\bigr)^{[0,n]}\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{KBRun}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,D,n)\\land D_n=(\\varnothing,R)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2576,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-completion-run.md]]"},{"id":"2735feec3db7f175","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{RedOrd}_{\\Sigma,V}(>)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；输入等式集 $E_0\\subseteq T^2$ 有限。假设 $\\mathrm{KBSuccess}_{\\Sigma,V,>}(E_0,R)$，采用 [[56-df-completion-run]] 的完整有限成功条件及 [[56-df-knuth-bendix-completion]] 的 Table 7.7 转移。$\\equiv_R^{\\Sigma,V}$ 将有序规则对视为等式对后取等式闭包。"}],"outgoing":["00208e314088402a"]}